{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c2caefd0623b5614","name":"Astromech Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-c2caefd0623b5614","title":"Astromech Droid","revision":15988,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:30Z","sha256":"d6411b3f8cb932e9b42949964b64832b68f66a1ab34527976ee54e6652dc9e31","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=15988","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Astromech%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c2caefd0623b5614","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["All Astromech Droids have the following Chassis Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Astromech Droids receive a +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},". Astromech Droids' intelligence and adaptability enable them to properly repair and maintain machinery.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["Like other Droids, Astromech Droids have no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," The vast majority of Astromech Droids are of Small size, giving them a + 1 size bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and a +5 size bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks. However, their lifting and carrying limits are three-quarters of those of Medium creatures."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Astromech Droids have a base speed of 6 squares and use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wheeled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wheeled","referenceId":"reference:cd7bb26315f7b177"}," Locomotion. Astromech Droids also have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," speed of 4 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Traits:"]}," Astromech Droids are ",{"tag":"a","children":["2nd-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/2nd-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:a314fe9a0993afad"}," and have all Droid immunities and typical ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Traits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Traits"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus Equipment:"]}," Astromech Droids are constructed with the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"}," installed in each:\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wheeled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wheeled","referenceId":"reference:cd7bb26315f7b177"}," Locomotion, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Walking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Walking","referenceId":"reference:1dabd5131fa6e9e4"}," Locomotion, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Magnetic Feet"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Magnetic_Feet","referenceId":"reference:16c326e31f21c93f"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Heuristic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heuristic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:0c5e1a481742e09b"}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["6 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tool Mounts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tool_Mounts"}," and 1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Claw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Claw","referenceId":"reference:587cfbbbcd42a71b"}," Appendage"]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["Astrogation Buffer (5 Memory Units), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Diagnostics Package"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Diagnostics_Package","referenceId":"reference:f18faca947488ff4"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Internal Storage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Internal_Storage"}," (2 kg)"]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Hardwired Design (",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},"):"]}," All Astromech Droids are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," skill. This is a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Conditional Bonus Feat:"]}," An Astromech Droid with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," can select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Mechanics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Mechanics)"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Use Computer)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Use_Computer)"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},". An Astromech Droid can take only one of these bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Astromech Droids can speak ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"}," and understand Basic."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
